{
  "id": 20,
  "type": "table",
  "title": "Sound camp overview + limits (v5)",
  "description": "Per-camp overview with the currently-active dB limit and a status flag. id/campname/tier come from the 'sensors' Google Sheet (Infinity); max_dbc is the sheet's max_dbc_now helper column (current sound_schedule limit for the camp's zone+tier, computed with NOW() in the spreadsheet). status = LCmax_r3m minus max_dbc: OK (<=0), ! (0-5 dB over), !!! (>5 dB over). LCmax trend is a sparkline of LCmax (sensor_sound_LCImax) over the panel range; ts_updated is the absolute time of the last sensor sample. LCmax/LCeq/LCmax_r3m (median over 3m) are computed; only LCmax_r3m is shown. dB scalars (LCmax_r3m, LCeq) add the per-sensor dbc_diff_abs offset from the sheet (0 when uncalibrated); the LCmax trend sparkline is not offset (a constant shift is invisible on an autoscaled sparkline). All dB values also include the ${correction_factor} calibration factor.",
  "gridPos": {
    "x": 0,
    "y": 0,
    "h": 30,
    "w": 24
  },
